# What `faraday_codec::classify` tells a scanned code apart by: the PSBT
# magic, binary and base64 (BIP-174), the UR scheme (BCR-2020-005),
# codex32's prefix (BIP-93), silent payment and segwit address prefixes
# (BIP-352, BIP-173, BIP-350), extended key prefixes (BIP-32, SLIP-132),
# BSMS records (BIP-129) and descriptor functions (BIP-380 to BIP-386,
# BIP-390). A libFuzzer dictionary: one entry a line.
